# Wave W-DIFF4: gravelfloor — lake-gravel street of Redwood
# Town (Pine & Lake Gravel kit). A pebble field in Wrathmere
# shore tones — lit pebbles over shadow, sage accent stones —
# with no coursing at all: gravel is shovelled, not laid, and
# that lawlessness is what separates Redwood's streets from
# every coursed floor in the game at a glance. Full-bleed,
# walkable street material. Authored art for the W-DIFF
# identity layer (muse-directive/W-DIFF-AUDIT.md Phase B:
# Redwood = gravelfloor).
